@ framework/yoshi. The tongue's "caught something" phase (0x607D0A4C, phase 2
@ of the Tongue mouth state) reads the catch's EatData type when the tongue is
@ back: YoshiFire/YoshiFireIce become a YoshiFlame in the mouth. Entry
@ `push {r4-r6, lr}` is position-independent. Ledger F0082.

Yoshi_tongueCaught:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x007D0A4C
    symbol:     ModBase::yoshi::tongueCaught(void*)
    trampoline: ModBase::yoshi::tongueCaught_orig(void*)
